As you may have seen previously, I got the chance to use Valrhona Praline so I thought I would make an Ultimate Valrhona Chocolate Ice Cream using the praline, cocoa and valrhona chocolate. 

The result is great, luxury, rich, decadent chocolate ice cream with a hint of caramel and hazelnut. 

Whilst this might be very expensive to make, it really is good. 

What you'll need:
300g Cream
375g Milk
110g Sugar
50g Dextrose
45g Cocoa
45g Skimmed Milk Ppowder
1.5g Stabilizer blend (optional)

50g Valrhona Caramelia
100g Valrhona Praline to swirl

